-- The far-wall face of a Kuhn simplex, restricted to the lower cube, is a
-- Kuhn simplex of one dimension less: its base is the restricted base and
-- its permutation is the rotated permutation restricted
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
